DATA SOURCES
  Job data is retrieved from publicly documented APIs and public job-board
  feeds. No content is scraped. Job postings remain the property of their
  respective employers and posting platforms. CareerPilot AI stores only
  what is needed to index and link to them, and links to the original
  posting rather than reproducing it in full.

